  "result": "I fixed all three digest problems. The type check reports no errors, and the digest job and notification service tests pass (14 of 14).\n\n1. **Only people who opted in get a digest:** `listDigestSubscribers` in `src/server/repositories/notification-preference-repository.ts` now counts only settings where digest delivery is chosen. Before, it picked up anyone with any notification setting in the workspace.\n2. **Newest updates are kept and listed first:** `buildDigest` in `src/server/services/digest-service.ts` now sorts updates newest first before applying the cap. The digest keeps the most recent ones, and the email's headline is the latest update.\n3. **Archived workspaces send nothing:** `shouldRunForOrg` in `src/server/jobs/digest-email-job.ts` now returns false for an archived workspace. As a second guard, `buildDigest` also returns nothing for one. Live workspaces work as before.",
